          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 4,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "@capgo/capacitor-pdf-viewer opens PDFs from device paths, HTTPS URLs with custom headers, or base64. You get page navigation, zoom, password-protected documents, fullscreen or inline layout, and load, error, page change, link tap, and close events."
